@MiniServiceDesk_Api_HostAddress = http://localhost:5129

### Get all tickets
GET {{MiniServiceDesk_Api_HostAddress}}/api/tickets
Accept: application/json

###

### Get ticket by id
GET {{MiniServiceDesk_Api_HostAddress}}/api/tickets/1
Accept: application/json

###

### Create ticket
POST {{MiniServiceDesk_Api_HostAddress}}/api/tickets
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "title": "Stampante ufficio bloccata",
  "description": "La stampante del piano 2 mostra errore carta anche senza inceppamenti.",
  "category": "IT",
  "priority": 1
}

###
